  "description": "meme-id: obama_voters; hasOverallIntent: hateful; overall-intent-description: The image depicts three chimpanzees in a forest setting, with the text 'obama voters' overlaid. This visual juxtaposition maps the image of chimpanzees — animals often stereotyped as unintelligent or primitive — onto a political group (Obama voters), implying that these voters are similarly primitive or unintelligent. This is a direct and derogatory attack on a specific demographic based on race and political affiliation, invoking a well-documented anti-Black stereotype that equates Black people with primates. The meme is designed to demean and dehumanize Obama voters, particularly those who are Black, by associating them with animalistic traits. This constitutes hateful content as it targets individuals based on their race and political beliefs, using a harmful and offensive racial stereotype to insult and belittle a group of people.",
